WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Cyber Terrain includes the devices, software, networks and services you look after.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
A device runs software. Networks connect devices. Together, they support ICT Systems and services.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Recorded relationships help explain how technical components fit together.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Understand what is recorded, how it connects and where the picture is incomplete.
